        {
          "id": "7171e6dd-0bef-3fc5-890d-ae71f908473d",
          "content": {
            "id": "7171e6dd-0bef-3fc5-890d-ae71f908473d",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Valmont Industries (VMI): $101 Million One-Off Loss Undermines Margin Recovery Narratives",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Valmont Industries (VMI) reported earnings expected to grow 16.2% per year, beating the US market\u2019s 15.5% forecast. Despite this, net profit margins slipped to 6.3% from last year\u2019s 7.3%, and a recent one-off loss of $101.4 million weighed down the latest twelve-month results. Although revenue growth is projected at 3.5% per year, lagging the broader US market\u2019s expected pace, investors may see continued profit growth and relative value, even as margins show pressure and revenue momentum...",
